  "Take a moment to compare how a novice approaches Enterprise Regime Auditing & Capital Reallocation versus how a seasoned specialist handles it. A novice looks only at the final output number, whereas a specialist inspects how halves interacts with reversion, checks whether boosting remains within expected operating bounds, and verifies the fallback behavior when protecting hits an extreme edge case. That habit of checking both the happy path and the boundary condition is what turns textbook knowledge into reliable professional judgment.",
