  "Why does this distinction matter so much when working through Enterprise Risk & Compliance Architecture Blueprint? Because in real-world engagements, small misconfigurations in Project or Surveillance rarely announce themselves with an obvious crash; instead, they quietly skew architecture until an independent reconciliation exposes the gap. By stepping through the logic of margin methodically and confirming each intermediate threshold, you build a repeatable habit that holds up under executive and regulatory scrutiny.",
