      "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <iomanip>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\nstruct SubsystemPillar {\n    int id;\n    std::string name;\n    std::string technology;\n    std::string latency_target;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << \"=== APEXQUANT SOVEREIGN PLATFORM MASTER ARCHITECTURAL CHARTER ===\\n\";\n    std::vector<SubsystemPillar> pillars = {\n        {1, \"Kernel-Bypass Ingestion\", \"Solarflare EF_VI / DPDK\", \"< 100 ns\"},\n        {2, \"Level 3 Limit Order Book\", \"Lock-Free Circular Ring\", \"< 150 ns\"},\n        {3, \"Micro-Price & Alpha Engine\", \"AVX-512 Vectorized OBI\", \"< 200 ns\"},\n        {4, \"SABR Volatility Surface\", \"Stochastic Vol Calibrator\", \"< 1.5 us\"},\n        {5, \"Portfolio Greeks & SPAN\", \"Parallel Black-Scholes/SPAN\", \"< 2.0 us\"},\n        {6, \"In-Line Pre-Trade Risk Gate\", \"SEC 15c3-5 Hardware Gate\", \"< 60 ns\"},\n        {7, \"Planetary Hybrid Router\", \"Microwave/Fiber Hitless\", \"< 4.1 ms RTT\"},\n        {8, \"Out-of-Band Kill Switch\", \"BGP Route Withdrawal / FPGA\", \"< 5 ms trip\"},\n        {9, \"Latency Governance Engine\", \"RDTSC Invariant Telemetry\", \"< 10 ns audit\"},\n        {10, \"Cryptographic Audit Trail\", \"IEEE 1588 PTP Hardware Log\", \"Zero Overhd\"}\n    };\n    \n    for (const auto& p : pillars) {\n        std::cout << \"Pillar \" << std::setw(2) << p.id << \": \"\n                  << std::left << std::setw(28) << p.name\n                  << \"[\" << std::setw(26) << p.technology << \"] \"\n                  << \"Target: \" << p.latency_target << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"Charter ratified: ApexQuant sovereign architecture initialized.\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}",
      "output": "=== APEXQUANT SOVEREIGN PLATFORM MASTER ARCHITECTURAL CHARTER ===\nPillar  1: Kernel-Bypass Ingestion      [Solarflare EF_VI / DPDK   ] Target: < 100 ns\nPillar  2: Level 3 Limit Order Book     [Lock-Free Circular Ring   ] Target: < 150 ns\nPillar  3: Micro-Price & Alpha Engine   [AVX-512 Vectorized OBI    ] Target: < 200 ns\nPillar  4: SABR Volatility Surface      [Stochastic Vol Calibrator ] Target: < 1.5 us\nPillar  5: Portfolio Greeks & SPAN      [Parallel Black-Scholes/SPAN] Target: < 2.0 us\nPillar  6: In-Line Pre-Trade Risk Gate  [SEC 15c3-5 Hardware Gate  ] Target: < 60 ns\nPillar  7: Planetary Hybrid Router      [Microwave/Fiber Hitless   ] Target: < 4.1 ms RTT\nPillar  8: Out-of-Band Kill Switch      [BGP Route Withdrawal / FPGA] Target: < 5 ms trip\nPillar  9: Latency Governance Engine    [RDTSC Invariant Telemetry ] Target: < 10 ns audit\nPillar 10: Cryptographic Audit Trail    [IEEE 1588 PTP Hardware Log] Target: Zero Overhd\nCharter ratified: ApexQuant sovereign architecture initialized.",
